{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"PMID:31647540; PMCID:PMC6938035; DOI:10.1093/brain/awz314\",\n    \"title\": \"Freezing of gait: understanding the complexity of an enigmatic phenomenon\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"review\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"not_applicable_secondary_review_PMID31647540\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"not_applicable_review\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"本文明确自称targeted review，未报告新的患者招募或原始电生理实验。下列证据来自不同原始研究的二级转述，不能将其视为本综述的独立患者队列，也不能仅凭本文确认不同原始研究的患者队列是否重叠。PMC页面显示该文章存在更正记录，指向Brain. 2020 Feb 4;143(3):e24；本附件未包含更正内容，因此更正版本对应关系未知。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"secondary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E01_Quinn2015_PMID26360123_STN_beta_standing\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Quinn EJ et al. Beta oscillations in freely moving Parkinson's subjects are attenuated during deep brain stimulation. Mov Disord. 2015;30:1750-1758. PMID:26360123; DOI:10.1002/mds.26376。综述未提供该比较的具体实验设计及患者分组细节。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病患者；综述报告比较了akinetic-rigid患者与tremor-dominant患者。不能据此将akinetic-rigid直接等同于FOG患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"本综述全文未报告Quinn原始研究的上述样本分母及电极数量。原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查，因此不能将缺失解释为原始研究全文未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；原文描述的是akinetic-rigid与tremor-dominant运动表型，而非FOG亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown；综述未报告测试时Med-On/Med-Off、剂量或给药时间。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"综述将相关STN记录概括为急性围术期或慢性术后记录，但未明确本项比较属于哪种记录设置，也未报告测试刺激ON/OFF、频率、幅度、脉宽、触点或方向性。\",\n      \"task\": \"站立（standing）。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"Subthalamic nucleus (STN)；具体记录位置、触点和信号采集方式未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta-band oscillatory activity。综述没有说明该指标具体是LFP功率、同步性、单单位活动还是其他频谱指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；精确频率边界、分析窗口、基线定义和归一化方式均未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：与tremor-dominant患者相比，akinetic-rigid帕金森病患者在站立期间具有增强的STN beta-band oscillatory activity。这是运动表型与STN活动的关联，不是Freezer与Non-freezer比较，也不是实际FOG事件相关结果。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：akinetic-rigid组beta活动较高。未报告效应量、组间差值、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"综述未报告患者级、试次级或记录级统计单位，也未报告统计检验、重复测量处理或模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单。原始研究未核查；综述自身为targeted review，未正式实施ROBIS或AMSTAR 2评价。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者明确说明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖，存在研究选择不完整的可能。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供原始研究招募流程、纳入排除标准或患者选择偏倚信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"该项结果没有报告FOG行为标签，不能评价FOG事件判定有效性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告STN信号质量、伪迹处理或电极接触质量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告药物状态、疾病严重程度、DBS状态等潜在混杂因素的控制情况。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告患者、试次和电极层级的统计处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告频段、条件和统计比较数量及多重比较校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述未描述该结果涉及预测模型或分类器。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有原始研究方案、预注册信息或完整结局报告可供核查。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"unclear\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不是FOG特异性证据。Akinetic-rigid与tremor-dominant是运动表型比较，不能推断beta增强就是FOG的神经标志物。该结果也不能与Freezer vs Non-freezer的事件级研究直接合并。综述没有提供原始信号类型及效应量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"enhanced beta band oscillatory activity during standing\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段；References，Quinn et al. 2015，B122。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E02_Quinn2015_PMID26360123_STN_beta_postural_transition\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Quinn EJ et al. PMID:26360123; DOI:10.1002/mds.26376。与E01为同一篇原始论文的不同任务条件，不应作为独立研究或独立队列重复计数。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病患者；综述在同一段描述akinetic-rigid与tremor-dominant表型，但没有明确说明本项姿势转换结果是否来自完全相同的分组比较。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告原始研究的患者数、有效神经记录人数、转换试次数或电极/触点数量；原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"综述提及急性围术期或慢性术后STN记录，但未明确本项结果的记录设置、测试刺激ON/OFF或刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"姿势转换，包括改变身体位置至坐位、卧位或行走；具体转换顺序及实验范式未报告。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；具体解剖亚区和记录触点未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta-band oscillatory activity；具体频谱统计指标不明。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；精确频率边界、姿势转换前后分析窗口、基线和归一化方式未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：STN beta-band activity在姿势转换期间受到抑制，包括从站立改变至坐位、卧位或行走。综述没有将这种抑制与实际FOG事件联系起来。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：姿势转换时beta活动下降或受到抑制。无数值效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级或试次级统计单位、转换事件数量、统计检验和重复测量处理均未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告原始患者招募及选择过程。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有报告FOG事件或冻结行为标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告姿势转换期间的信号伪迹控制及信号质量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态、刺激状态及姿势转换顺序的潜在混杂控制不明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告患者级与转换试次级数据如何建模。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告姿势和频段比较的多重检验控制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有报告该结果使用预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无原始研究方案和完整结果可供比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，Quinn et al. 2015转述段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"unclear\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是姿势转换相关的STN活动调制，不是冻结前或冻结期间的信号。不能把行走这一姿势转换条件直接认定为发生FOG。与E01属于同一原始论文，应合并为同一study_id候选下的不同任务证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"suppressed during postural transitions\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段；References，Quinn et al. 2015，B122。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E03_Storzer2017_PMID28892573_STN_beta_gait_initiation\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Storzer L et al. Bicycling suppresses abnormal beta synchrony in the Parkinsonian basal ganglia. Ann Neurol. 2017;82:592-601. PMID:28892573; DOI:10.1002/ana.25047。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病Freezer与Non-freezer患者。综述未提供两组人数、Freezer判定标准或疾病特征。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告患者分母、有效STN记录人数、启动试次数及FOG事件数。原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；仅报告Freezer与Non-freezer分组，未报告akinetic、trembling-in-place或其他冻结亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown；未报告Med-On/Med-Off、剂量或测试时间。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN神经记录；DBS临床状态、测试刺激状态及频率、幅度、脉宽、触点均未在综述中报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"Gait initiation。综述报告的是启动任务期间的事件相关活动，没有说明该启动试次随后是否出现实际FOG。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；具体解剖位置及左右侧未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Event-related STN beta-band activity；综述未说明具体采用功率、同步性或其他频谱指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；精确频率边界及事件相关分析窗未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：PD Freezer患者在gait initiation期间表现出增强的STN event-related beta-band activity，而Non-freezer患者未观察到这一现象。这是Freezer与Non-freezer表型比较，不能自动认定为同一试次中FOG发生前的事件相关活动。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：Freezer组增强，Non-freezer组未观察到相同表现。没有报告效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"未报告患者级、启动试次级或事件级统计单位，也未报告统计模型、重复测量处理和多重比较方法。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告Freezer和Non-freezer的招募、纳入标准及组间可比性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段；References，B151。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告Freezer诊断标准、FOG问卷阈值或视频/临床确认方法。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供该研究的STN记录质量和伪迹处理细节。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告药物状态、运动严重程度、刺激状态及启动策略等混杂因素控制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告患者与启动试次的统计层级。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告频段和任务比较的多重检验校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述未报告该项结果涉及预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"缺少原始方案和完整结果，不能评价选择性报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"unclear\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"本项支持的是Freezer表型与gait initiation期间STN beta活动的关联，不足以支持pre_FOG_event_associated。综述没有说明启动试次是否随后发生冻结，也没有报告冻结的临床确认方法。原始论文标题强调bicycling，综述则将该文用于gait initiation证据；具体实验任务需要通过原始论文核查，不能仅凭综述消除这一细节上的不确定性。\",\n      \"quote\": \"enhanced event-related beta band activity in the STN during gait initiation\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第二段；References，Storzer et al. 2017，B151。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E04_Fischer2018_PMID29760182_STN_beta_stepping\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Fischer P et al. Alternating modulation of subthalamic nucleus beta oscillations during stepping. J Neurosci. 2018;38:5111-5121. PMID:29760182; DOI:10.1523/JNEUROSCI.3596-17.2018。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病患者；综述未说明Freezer与Non-freezer构成、样本数量或具体临床表型。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告该原始研究的患者分母、步态试次数、冻结事件数和电极数量；原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN神经记录；综述未报告临床DBS状态、测试刺激状态及刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"Stepping。综述另提到stepping in place和walking条件用于讨论机械伪迹，但没有提供完整任务协议。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；具体记录位置、侧别及触点未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta-band oscillatory activity；具体功率、相位调制或burst指标未在综述中说明。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；具体频率边界、步态周期相位窗口、基线和归一化方式未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：STN beta-band activity与stepping存在调制关系。该发现描述步态/踏步过程中的神经活动变化，不是FOG事件的直接比较，也没有报告冻结前或冻结期间的STN信号。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"仅有定性调制描述；综述没有报告调制方向、数值效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"未报告步态周期级、试次级或患者级统计单位，也未报告统计方法。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有提供原始患者招募及选择标准。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，B44。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"该项转述没有报告FOG标签或冻结事件结局。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述明确指出步态机械扰动可能造成频谱变化伪迹。作者同时指出Fischer研究在stepping in place与walking时存在相似的机械扰动，提供了部分控制依据，但仍建议进一步验证STN侧化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段，机械扰动及STN侧化讨论。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物、DBS状态和运动条件的混杂控制细节未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告步态周期和患者层级统计处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告不同步态相位和频段的多重比较校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有报告该项结果涉及预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有原始研究方案和完整分析结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是理解正常或非冻结步态期间STN beta调制的重要参照，但不能直接作为FOG的异常神经活动证据。综述明确指出机械步态扰动可能混淆频谱调制结果，并提出进一步确认STN活动是否侧化至摆动腿对侧STN的必要性。正常步态周期调制与Freezer中的持续beta burst不能合并成一个笼统的beta异常指标。\",\n      \"quote\": \"beta band activity at the level of STN is modulated with stepping\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，Fischer et al. 2018，B44。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E05_Hell2018_PMID29307607_STN_beta_gait_cycle_attribution_uncertain\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源的研究归属记录。综述引用Hell F et al. Subthalamic stimulation, oscillatory activity and connectivity reveal functional role of STN and network mechanisms during decision making under conflict. Neuroimage. 2018;171:222-233. PMID:29307607; DOI:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2018.01.001。原始文献题名与综述所述步态周期调制之间存在明显的主题对应疑点。\",\n      \"population\": \"unknown；综述没有提供与步态周期结果相对应的具体患者群体。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述没有提供该项步态周期结果的原始样本分母。由于所引用文献题名涉及decision making under conflict，尚不能从附件确认该研究是否实际包含步态任务。原始研究全文未核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"原始文献题名涉及subthalamic stimulation，但综述没有提供与其步态周期陈述对应的具体刺激状态或频率、幅度、脉宽和触点。\",\n      \"task\": \"综述将其描述为throughout the gait cycle，但原始文献题名为decision making under conflict；实际步态任务及其是否存在，均需原始论文核查。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；具体记录位置和信号类型未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"综述归属的STN beta-band activity modulation；具体指标和统计量不明。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；精确频率边界及步态周期分析窗口均未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述称Hell et al. 2018提供了STN beta activity throughout the gait cycle调制的证据。但该文在本综述参考文献中的正式题名是关于decision making under conflict。现有附件只能确认综述作出了这一引用，不能确认原始研究实际报告了步态周期调制或FOG相关结果。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"无可核查的效应方向、数值效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"unknown；综述没有提供与该步态周期陈述相对应的统计单位和分析方法。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；存在原始文献与二级引用内容对应不明确的问题。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"步态结果对应的患者样本无法从综述中确认。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，B69。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法确认所引用原始研究是否包含FOG行为标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"缺乏可确认的步态任务和对应信号处理信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物、刺激及任务条件信息不足。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有可核查的步态周期级统计分析信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有对应的频段及任务比较细节。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有可确认的FOG预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"citation_mapping\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述将该文作为步态周期STN beta调制依据，但参考文献题名指向冲突决策任务，二者对应关系未能由附件确认。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，B69。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有可核查的原始研究完整结果。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不能将该引用作为已确认的独立步态电生理重复验证。需要核查DOI:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2018.01.001的原始全文，确认是否存在步态任务及其对应的STN信号结果。在完成核查前，该证据应标记为citation_attribution_uncertain，不应参与STN-FOG效应方向的合并分析。\",\n      \"quote\": \"throughout the gait cycle\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，Hell et al. 2018，B69。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E06A_Anidi2018_PMID30196050_STN_beta_burst_duration\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Anidi C et al. Neuromodulation targets pathological not physiological beta bursts during gait in Parkinson's disease. Neurobiol Dis. 2018;120:107-117. PMID:30196050; DOI:10.1016/j.nbd.2018.09.004。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病Freezer患者；综述未报告Freezer人数、对照组人数及Freezer定义。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告原始研究各患者分母、有效神经记录人数、FOG事件数、步态试次数或电极数量；原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；只报告Freezer患者，没有提供akinetic、trembling-in-place等冻结亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"使用DBS sensing technology获取STN beta信号；综述没有说明测试时刺激是否开启，以及频率、幅度、脉宽和触点配置。\",\n      \"task\": \"Gait；原始论文题名涉及during gait，但综述未给出具体步态协议、转弯或启动条件。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；通过DBS sensing technology记录，具体接触点和解剖位置未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta-band burst duration。该条只提取burst持续时间，不与burst幅度、功率或占据率合并。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；具体频率边界、burst检测阈值、持续时间计算规则、分析窗口和基线均未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：PD Freezer患者的STN beta-band bursts持续时间延长。综述没有说明这些延长的burst是否发生在实际FOG之前、期间或恢复阶段，因此只能归入Freezer表型易感性证据。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：burst duration prolonged。未报告持续时间数值、组间差值、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"未报告患者级与burst级统计单位、每位患者burst数量、统计模型或重复测量处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告Freezer组招募标准和原始患者选择流程。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，B3。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告Freezer定义、FOG诊断确认方式或视频/临床评审。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述指出步态机械扰动可能造成频谱变化伪迹，并认为需要进一步排除该解释。没有提供Anidi研究具体伪迹控制方法。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段，机械扰动和伪迹讨论。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态、刺激状态和疾病严重程度控制信息未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告burst级数据是否按患者聚类或使用重复测量模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告频段、burst指标和任务条件比较的校正方法。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有提供该结果对应的预测模型信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无原始研究方案及完整结局数据。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果支持Freezer表型与STN beta burst持续时间延长之间的关联，但不能证明延长发生在实际冻结事件前。尤其不能将burst持续时间与平均beta功率或burst幅度视为相同指标。综述未提供burst检测阈值、时间分布或患者级效应量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"STN beta band bursts were prolonged\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，Anidi et al. 2018，B3。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E06B_Anidi2018_PMID30196050_STN_beta_burst_enhancement\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始神经电生理研究。原始研究：Anidi C et al. PMID:30196050; DOI:10.1016/j.nbd.2018.09.004。与E06A属于同一篇原始论文、同一研究候选，不构成独立重复验证。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病Freezer患者；具体人数、比较组及分组标准未报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告原始研究的样本分母、事件数、试次数及电极数量；原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；未报告具体冻结运动学亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"采用DBS sensing technology记录STN beta bursts；测试刺激状态及具体参数未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"Gait；具体行走条件及是否包括转弯、启动或实际冻结事件未报告。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN；具体触点和记录解剖位置未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta-band burst enhancement。综述没有定义enhanced具体指burst幅度、功率、发生率、占据率还是其他指标，因此不得将其直接解释为平均beta功率增加。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；具体频率边界、增强指标的定义、时间窗和基线未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：PD Freezer患者的STN beta-band bursts enhanced。该描述与burst duration prolonged是不同的信号特征；本条只记录增强，不推断增强的具体数学定义。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性方向：Freezer患者的beta bursts增强。没有报告具体增强指标、数值效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级或burst级统计单位、指标聚合方式、统计模型和重复测量处理均未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"Freezer组选择和样本代表性未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，B3。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"Freezer判定标准和实际FOG确认方式未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述明确指出步态机械扰动可能混淆beta频谱变化，且未提供Anidi研究的具体伪迹排除细节。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段，机械扰动和伪迹讨论。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物、刺激和疾病严重程度的混杂控制不明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告burst级重复测量是否按患者聚类处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告不同beta burst指标的多重比较处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述未报告与该指标相关的预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法获得原始研究完整指标列表及分析方案。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"enhanced在综述中没有操作性定义。不能将其擅自改写为平均beta功率升高、burst幅度增大或burst占据率升高。该结果与E06A是同一研究的不同信号描述，不能作为第二项独立患者队列证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"enhanced in Parkinson's disease freezers\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第三段；References，Anidi et al. 2018，B3。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E07_Pozzi2019_DOI10.1093_brain_awz141_transition\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始研究候选：Pozzi et al., 2019，DOI:10.1093/brain/awz141。综述未在参考文献表中提供该文对应的完整题名和PMID。特别注意：正文引用链接指向B158，而B158实际为Valentino et al. 2014的tDCS研究，因此存在错误的文内参考链接；本条以正文直接提供的DOI作为原始来源候选。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病患者；综述描述疾病优势半球以及较少纹状体多巴胺能支配的情况，但没有明确报告Freezer分组、样本构成或患者数量。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告该原始研究的患者、有效神经记录、FOG事件、试次及电极分母。原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查；正文DOI存在，但参考文献链接错误。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN-cortical神经同步记录；综述未报告患者既往DBS状态、测试刺激状态或刺激参数。\",\n      \"task\": \"综述描述为gait transition phase，但没有说明是否为自然直立行走、启动、转弯、双任务或其他任务，也没有确认该过渡试次随后是否发生实际FOG。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN与cortex之间的神经同步；疾病优势半球。具体皮层区域、STN接触点和侧别细节未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN-cortical neuronal synchronization。综述没有进一步说明具体采用coherence、phase-locking value、相位同步或其他耦合指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"4-13 Hz；分析阶段为综述所述transition phase。具体时间窗、基线、归一化、频率子带和统计计算方式未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：在疾病优势半球、纹状体多巴胺能支配较少的情况下，STN与皮层之间的神经同步在4-13 Hz范围内出现异常，且这一异常被描述为发生于transition phase。综述没有说明该transition试次是否随后确实出现FOG，因此不能标为pre_FOG_event_associated。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性描述为neuronal synchronization derangement。未报告具体增强或降低方向、耦合系数、效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"未报告患者级、试次级或冻结事件级统计单位，也未报告同步性计算方法、统计模型和重复测量处理。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查，且综述文内参考链接存在映射问题。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者招募和样本选择细节未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；DOI 10.1093/brain/awz141。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"transition phase的行为定义、FOG事件确认方式及是否与后续冻结事件配对均未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告STN和皮层信号质量、运动伪迹处理或跨区同步伪迹控制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态、纹状体多巴胺能支配程度及疾病严重程度之间的混杂控制未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告同步性计算的患者、试次及事件统计层级。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告4-13 Hz范围内频段比较和多重检验校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有报告该结果涉及预测模型或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"citation_mapping\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"正文提供DOI 10.1093/brain/awz141，但文内参考链接指向B158，实际对应Valentino et al. 2014，不能把该错误链接当作正确的原始文献标识。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；References，B158。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"缺少原始研究完整分析结果和研究方案。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是跨区STN-cortical同步证据，与局部STN beta功率或beta burst持续时间属于不同信号维度，不能合并为同一种beta异常。transition phase不等于已经证实的pre-FOG event。综述没有报告是否同一试次随后出现冻结。原始文献的PMID及准确题名仍需通过DOI核查；正文错误链接必须保留为来源审计问题。\",\n      \"quote\": \"from 4 Hz to 13 Hz in the transition phase\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；正文直接DOI链接10.1093/brain/awz141；文内引用锚点B158实际对应Valentino et al. 2014。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E08_Pozzi2019_DOI10.1093_brain_awz141_during_FOG\",\n      \"design\": \"二级来源转述的原始研究候选：Pozzi et al., 2019，DOI:10.1093/brain/awz141。与E07属于同一原始研究候选的不同事件阶段，不能作为独立研究或独立患者队列计数。综述正文引用锚点B158实际指向Valentino et al. 2014，存在文内参考链接错误。\",\n      \"population\": \"帕金森病患者；综述提及疾病优势半球和较少纹状体多巴胺能支配，但没有提供Freezer患者数量或具体分组。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": null,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"综述全文未报告患者数、实际冻结事件数、有效神经记录人数、试次数和电极数量。原始研究全文未在本次附件中核查，且正文参考链接映射错误。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；综述未说明akinetic、trembling-in-place或其他FOG亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"STN-cortical神经同步记录；DBS临床状态、测试刺激状态及刺激参数均未报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"综述明确描述为during FoG，但没有说明是自然直立行走、视频确认、临床评审、运动学检测还是其他FOG识别方式。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN与cortex之间的神经同步；疾病优势半球。皮层具体位置及STN触点未报告。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN-cortical neuronal synchronization；具体耦合统计量未说明。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"4-13 Hz；分析阶段为during FoG。具体冻结事件窗口、事件前后时间、基线和归一化方法未报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"综述报告：STN与皮层之间4-13 Hz范围的神经同步异常不仅出现在transition phase，也被描述为出现在during FoG阶段。这是综述明确提到的冻结期间关联，但未说明FOG的行为确认方法，因此不能进一步认定为A_actual_natural。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"定性描述为neuronal synchronization derangement；没有报告方向、数值效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"未报告每位患者冻结事件数量、事件级统计方法、患者级聚合方式或重复测量模型。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性电生理研究领域清单；原始研究未核查。\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"secondary_review_selection_completeness\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者声明本综述不追求各研究领域的完整覆盖。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Introduction，targeted review范围说明。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"sample_selection\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告FOG患者的招募标准和样本构成。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；DOI 10.1093/brain/awz141。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"behavioral_label_validity\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"虽然综述明确使用during FoG，但未报告视频或临床确认、客观运动学阈值和事件判定者信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"signal_quality_and_artifacts\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告冻结期间STN及皮层信号伪迹控制、信号质量或跨区同步分析的可靠性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"confounding\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态、运动严重程度及多巴胺能支配程度等潜在混杂因素的处理不明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"repeated_measures_and_pseudoreplication\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有冻结事件级与患者级统计单位及重复测量处理信息。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"multiple_comparisons\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有报告频段、事件阶段和脑区组合的多重比较校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"model_overfitting_and_external_validation\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"综述没有报告该结果使用预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"citation_mapping\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"正文DOI与文内参考链接不一致，B158实际指向Valentino et al. 2014，存在原始来源追踪风险。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；References，B158。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"selective_reporting\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法获得原始研究完整事件级结果和预设分析方案。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是本文所列STN-FOG关系中最接近实际冻结期间跨区神经活动的证据，但仍属于二级转述。不能从综述推断冻结发生于自然直立行走，也不能推断其经过视频或临床评审。4-13 Hz跨区同步与STN局部beta功率、beta burst持续时间是不同指标。E07与本条应保留同一study_id候选，并分别记录transition与during_FOG阶段。\",\n      \"quote\": \"during FoG\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Insights from neurophysiology，第四段；正文DOI链接10.1093/brain/awz141；文内引用锚点B158实际对应Valentino et al. 2014。\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "493a919e-7875-4ac4-9dc8-9aaa58a8185e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T112817118722Z", "elapsed_seconds": 591.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:38:08.179905+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc8b155d85d5dbb8aa5442b9e127662159cec5ae603d937eb006dbd794704c92", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"too